l>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\">\\(D,\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2Diagram}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2Diagram}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (elementary-diagram predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}diagram} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2Diagram}_S(D,\\mathcal M,L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\{\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\times\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\mid\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model2\\text{-}diagram} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel2Diagram}_S(D,\\mathcal M,L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land D=\\{\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\times\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\mid\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The diagram is represented by formula-assignment pairs evaluated by one certified satisfaction recursion; a finite tuple is not passed to the assignment-sensitive satisfaction relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading